# as "{tens} {units}" ("hai mươi hai"), except where Vietnamese changes the unit after "mươi":
# 1 becomes "mốt" (21, 31 ... 91) and 5 becomes "lăm" (25, 35 ... 95; 15 = "mười lăm"), listed below.
